{"name": "ASHGARD: Infinity Mask", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"234\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372950/extras/28ed17818cc7bf77a1b321c9bfb8715c.avif?t=1781082809\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ASHGARD: Infinity Mask</strong> is an atmospheric third-person action-adventure that combines intense melee and ranged combat with platforming, puzzles, and a deep narrative. Inspired by Norse mythology, the game takes you into a world after Ragnar\u00f6k \u2013 shattered, forgotten, and full of secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"228\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372950/extras/58e71ccfb086d28a5bf259588416ab95.poster.avif?t=1781082809\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372950/extras/58e71ccfb086d28a5bf259588416ab95.webm?t=1781082809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372950/extras/58e71ccfb086d28a5bf259588416ab95.mp4?t=1781082809\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"59\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372950/extras/8e96213517d458f7dfa04e8a8367b88c.webp?t=1781082809\" width=\"616\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"81\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372950/extras/bb72a712ce9e450aa8aa05fe12cd56c2.avif?t=1781082809\" width=\"616\"/></span><br/>You play as <strong>Embla</strong>, an <i>Androm</i> \u2013 a hybrid being of machine and human soul. Awakened on a scrapyard with no memory of the time before the fall, you embark on a journey through decaying villages, vibrant biomes, and ancient temples to uncover your origin and the truth behind the Infinity Mask. The deeper you venture into the world, the more you discover about the Ragnar\u00f6k that once occurred \u2013 and the role the gods played in it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"228\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372950/extras/070a94ae61cc6a33d371c5c8a5904fbe.poster.avif?t=1781082809\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372950/extras/070a94ae61cc6a33d371c5c8a5904fbe.webm?t=1781082809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372950/extras/070a94ae61cc6a33d371c5c8a5904fbe.mp4?t=1781082809\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"59\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372950/extras/8e96213517d458f7dfa04e8a8367b88c.webp?t=1781082809\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"81\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372950/extras/10dfc0d317c2460e8980f38ea803577a.avif?t=1781082809\" width=\"616\"/></span><br/>Master challenging battles against other Androms and various corruption-born creatures to help Embla unleash her full strength. But beware: some enemies are extremely powerful and will require both careful preparation and strategic thinking to defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"228\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372950/extras/6d634d5c510cfe52e5116d17ff912a67.poster.avif?t=1781082809\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372950/extras/6d634d5c510cfe52e5116d17ff912a67.webm?t=1781082809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372950/extras/6d634d5c510cfe52e5116d17ff912a67.mp4?t=1781082809\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"59\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372950/extras/8e96213517d458f7dfa04e8a8367b88c.webp?t=1781082809\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"81\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372950/extras/5482c22347eae3d7b6b349ea0396e262.avif?t=1781082809\" width=\"616\"/></span><br/>With different gadgets and abilities, you can guide Embla through the world in various ways. Each gadget grants unique powers and can also be used in combat to gain an advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"228\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372950/extras/40b6ffc161a64b70e4904358484dfb76.poster.avif?t=1781082809\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372950/extras/40b6ffc161a64b70e4904358484dfb76.webm?t=1781082809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372950/extras/40b6ffc161a64b70e4904358484dfb76.mp4?t=1781082809\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"59\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372950/extras/8e96213517d458f7dfa04e8a8367b88c.webp?t=1781082809\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"81\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372950/extras/e2220195de5ea71fe8475eb3470fc007.avif?t=1781082809\" width=\"616\"/></span><br/>Collect <strong>Nidra</strong> to upgrade your equipment, purchase support items, or expand your skill tree. Every upgrade affects your stats differently, so it\u2019s worth exploring the world and finding as many unique items as possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"228\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372950/extras/ad4d889f269c59c0662ee40fe551ed62.poster.avif?t=1781082809\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372950/extras/ad4d889f269c59c0662ee40fe551ed62.webm?t=1781082809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372950/extras/ad4d889f269c59c0662ee40fe551ed62.mp4?t=1781082809\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"59\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372950/extras/8e96213517d458f7dfa04e8a8367b88c.webp?t=1781082809\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"228\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372950/extras/89bd154d52fdaa17d758b58f52167c32.poster.avif?t=1781082809\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372950/extras/89bd154d52fd